      "The volume that contains a lock of hair and the fourth shelf are exactly one shelf apart in shelf order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The second shelf is exactly one shelf lower than a treatise on clocks, with no shelf in between.",
      "The fourth shelf is exactly one shelf lower than a book of sea shanties, with no shelf in between.",
      "A guide to fungi does not contain a postcard from Hull."
